        "value": "<h3 data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"741\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"739\">GROSS EXAMINATION:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"873\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"809\">\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"809\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Received __ core(s) of renal tissue measuring ____ cm in total.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"873\">\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"873\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Processed for Light Microscopy and Direct Immunofluorescence.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"916\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"914\">LIGHT MICROSCOPY FINDINGS:</strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"961\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"933\">Stains Used:</strong> H&amp;E, PAS, Silver, Trichrome</span></p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" style=\"width: 73.0748%;\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1361\">\n<thead data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1012\">\n<tr data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1012\">\n<th style=\"width: 62.6791%;\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"997\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Feature</span></th>\n<th style=\"width: 37.2493%;\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1012\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Observation</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1361\">\n<tr data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1112\">\n<td style=\"width: 62.6791%;\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1097\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Number of glomeruli</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 37.2493%;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1112\